  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I couldn't get the full $15.00 onto your card, because the policy doesn't allow it. I've done the $12.00 and $3.00 split:\n\n- **$12.00 refunded** to your Visa ending 4242. It should arrive in 3-5 business days.\n- **$3.00 credited** to your Forkful account. Your balance is now $3.00.\n\nI'm sorry about the missing pho, Owen. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for sorting it out. I'm not thrilled about the credit since I probably won't be back, but I appreciate you getting the refund through. That's all I needed."
